            "review_text": "Caz C\nAnsiao, Portugal732 contributions\n0\nTasty food but dreadful service\nJul 2017 • Couples\nIt looks quite swanky when you walk in but the staff were not helpful. We ordered our food and they came back twice to clarify our order. The food came and it was tasty. BBQ ribs and lemongrass chicken and an enormous bowl of rice which we sent back as we asked for one bowl to share. The chicken looked like breast but in fact had bones in so beware. The prices were very expensive. Service was poor - we sat for about fifteen minutes with empty glasses being ignored by the staff. We will not be back!\nRead more\nWritten July 13, 2017",
