            "review_text": "Incey W\nGreater Manchester, United Kingdom85 contributions\n0\nOverpriced and underwhelming\nApr 2017 • Family\nStumbled on this just walking round at dinner time, all thought it looked nice and would be a change from the chickens organs and feet we'd had the night before - nowt wrong with em like but fancied something we were more used to! Actually wish we'd stuck with the local stuff. Should've been suss after ordering a pineapple juice and receiving what looked and tasted like a glass of dirty dish water, however, we stayed put and were treated to overcooked and undercooked tasteless meat - a feat in and of itself. All of us had ordered medium cooked steaks, 1 was dry as a bone and the other 2 were close to still breathing, Dad came out a winner saying his fish was lovely (I put it down to him being 75 and having few taste buds left in all honesty!) With a bill topping 2million for four of us we didn't and wouldn't return.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 29, 2017",
