            "review_text": "Khanh P\n16 contributions\n0\nNever ever come here\nNov 2016 • Friends\nOk!! You want to know why? \nthe restaurant is really a good place with nice decoration and that's only good thing.\nWe have a place at the sofa where we booked (hot and stuffy)\n\nThe food: we have salad, cuttle fish, duck,rice (pictures), and Non of them are good if i compare to the street foods. The seafood were all fresh but the taste was so strange. Very Unprofessional. I want to write more about the food but i really don't wanna think about it anymore. They should hire another Chef\n\nAnd the wrost thing is Wine, I ordered a bordeaux white wine from France. They brings out right bottle but it's warm, why don't they keep it cold!!!! Even though they served with ice after. I can't stand with the wrost wine.\n\nFinally, the staff were all be nice but they're so innocent, confused and unprofessional. When we're still eating (10:pm) some of the light turned off. I droped hint with the staff\"what's happen?\", she looks at me and says \"we turn it off\", oh wow, I know you want to go home but please I haven't finished yet. We came at 9:pm , quite deserted. I saw 2 small group (birthday or something) but the staff were so confusing,they didn't use to it. \nWe're group of 3, 2 local and 1 japanese. I don't mean any thing but I am the one who pay the bill, and they're just surrounding the japanese guy hahaha. \nSo I don't know who rated this place more than 3 stars but please don't ever come here if you don't want to waste your time. The manager seems like they don't mind about the customers like it or not.\nRead more\nWritten November 29, 2016",
