            "review_text": "Bert D\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam36 contributions\n0\nGlamour in Facility Doesn't makes a Restaurant Good\nOct 2016 • Business\nEntertained some Customer at this quite nice modern designed Restaurant. Our Party of 20, pre ordered the food in advance. Chosen mainly Seafood dishes as well as a couple of meat dishes. The Food can be rated as average with some being good and some just okay. It would have been perhaps a bid better if food was hot, the first 3 dishes of our 10 course dinner where cold, which leaves me to say that the Service is a far cry from a level expected in such a place. To equip one staff with a Walky talky does not make a supervisor. It is clearly noticed that staff does not have sufficient knowledge and training received to provide a professional Service Standard, which would be expected in such restaurant. Would only chose this restaurant again if improvements are made F&B standard.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten October 21, 2016",
